# Open in VS Code and click "Send Request" (REST Client extension).
# Local run (dotnet run): http://localhost:5201   Through Traefik (later): http://localhost:8000
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5201

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/health

### All invoices (created by orders-api over gRPC when an order is placed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/invoices

### One invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/invoices/1

### Pay an invoice (fake gateway: always approves)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/invoices/1/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "4111 1111 1111 1111"
}
